{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（2日）上午11時半左右，將軍澳駿日街16號一個地盤發生工業意外，一名姓林（51歲）工人操作手提電磨機時不慎鎅傷手，由同事報警。</p><p>警方接報到場，事主清醒被送往將軍澳醫院治理。經初步調查，相信他工作期間意外被機器割傷左手。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主手部受傷，被送到將軍澳醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193935477690863616076432.jpeg/7rfuYr4vehJm-StpGgHAtKZ2ZgtTZ_tbi0Ghh4tBoYc\"/><figcaption>事主手部受傷，被送到將軍澳醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:41:03.050335+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:21:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:42.509099+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:38:35.441161+00:00","content_hash":"39fe6f7bbe17a5d709d6969ffccbb26e3d1915334631c9a26119421b15b4b64e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}